  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ミミッキュの　じゃれつくを\nＺワザに　グレードアップする\nＺパワーの　けっしょうを　つくりだす。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "따라큐의 치근거리기를\nZ기술로 업그레이드하는\nZ파워의 결정을 만들어 낸다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "可用來製造將\n謎擬Ｑ的嬉鬧\n升級為Ｚ招式的Ｚ力量結晶。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Permet de concentrer la Force Z en un cristal,\nqui autorise le Mimiqui qui le tient à transformer\nsa capacité Câlinerie en capacité Z.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kristallisierte Z-Kraft, die Mimigmas Attacke\nKnuddler zu einer Z-Attacke aufstuft.\nWird bei Bedarf automatisch vervielfacht.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Concentra el Poder Z en cristales que permiten a\nMimikyu convertir su Carantoña en un movimiento Z.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Permette di creare cristalli carichi di Potere Z che\nconsentono a Mimikyu di trasformare la mossa\nCarineria in una mossa Z.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It converts Z-Power into crystals that upgrade\nMimikyu’s Play Rough to an exclusive Z-Move.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
